command_context:
  query: file:"/var/log/zsh/history.jsonl"
  limit: 100
  fields:
  - _time
  - _msg
  - exit_code
  - user
  - host
  instructions: >-
    Recent shell commands run by the user on all hosts (rows newest first;
    fields: _time, _msg = command line, exit_code, user, host). Correlation
    only, never alert on these rows: check whether errors align with admin
    actions (deploys, restarts, updates, config edits) on the same host just
    before the error window, and cite the likely trigger command when it
    lines up.
